Genex Windows Community
=======================

This is an UNOFFICIAL community fork of Genex (https://github.com/genex-games/genex-desktop),
made to run better on Windows and with any OpenAI-compatible local model server.

It is not made, endorsed or supported by the Genex authors (genex-games). "Genex" refers to the
original project; the fork uses its own name and icon and does not use the official Genex logo.

